# Hullbreacher: "If an opponent would draw a card except the first one ..., instead you create a Treasure token." With two
# Hullbreachers on the battlefield each draw is still replaced once (CR 616.1, 614.6: a replaced event is gone and the
# second replacement has nothing left to apply to). Bot1 flashes both in on turn 1; on turn 2 Bot2 draws for the turn
# (the exempt first card of its draw step) and casts Brainstorm: its three draws become exactly three Treasures, not six.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Hullbreacher
Hullbreacher
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Brainstorm
Island x6
Mountain
Island x12

